---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const title = "Waste Disposal Website";
const description =
  "A clear service website and custom order form designed to simplify waste collection requests.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="max-w-2xl">
    <p class="mb-4 text-sm tracking-wide text-text-light">
      <a href="/projects" class="hover:text-primary">← Projects</a>
    </p>
    <p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] text-text-light uppercase">Web Design</p>
    <h1 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-black text-text-dark md:text-5xl">{title}</h1>
    <p class="mb-8 text-text-light">{description}</p>

    <img
      src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518773553398-650c184e0bb3?w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80"
      alt=""
      width="1200"
      height="800"
      class="mb-10 w-full rounded-lg object-cover"
      loading="eager"
    />

    <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl text-text-dark">Overview</h2>
    <p class="mb-4 text-text-light">
      Waste collection services involve details that can quickly overwhelm a customer: material type, volume,
      location, timing, and access requirements. This project organizes those decisions into a straightforward
      website and guided request flow.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-10 text-text-light">
      Clear language and strong hierarchy keep the service understandable while helping the business receive more
      complete order information.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl text-text-dark">Approach</h2>
    <p class="mb-4 text-text-light">
      The page structure puts the most common customer questions first, then uses the order form to collect only the
      information relevant to each request.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-10 text-text-light">
      Responsive layouts and generous touch targets keep the experience practical for customers submitting a request
      from the job site as well as from a desktop.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl text-text-dark">Focus areas</h2>
    <ul class="mb-10 list-disc pl-5 text-text-light space-y-1">
      <li>Service information architecture</li>
      <li>Responsive web interface</li>
      <li>Custom order form UX</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Layout>
